WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.027 --> 00:00:01.050
(audience applauding)

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.110
- Welcome to "The Kelly
Clarkson Show," everybody.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.840
I know what you're possibly
thinking right now.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.820
Why is there an audience in the studio

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.680
and I am here in the monitor?

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.580
'Tis the season to spend a little time

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.229
home for the holidays.

00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:18.463
♪ Home for the holidays ♪

00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:19.716
(audience applauding)

00:00:19.716 --> 00:00:20.700
(Kelly chuckling)

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.140
- Get it, Jess.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.930
So, I don't really want
to be at home right now.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.150
I'm actually here getting over COVID,

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.550
which, well, sucks.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.510
It's the worst.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.860
So, (chuckling)

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.390
but I'm feeling better

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.510
and I could not miss this show.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.820
I am such a fan (giggling)

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.340
of this person that's
about to start this show,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.890
so, even not feeling well, I showed up,

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.960
because the show must
go on and I love her.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.250
So, as always,
(audience cheering)

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.430
we are gonna kick things off
first, though, with some music.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.700
This is a fun Kellyoke
encore of me, Jimmy Fallon,

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.220
and my band, Y'all, doing
"I've Got You Babe."

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.498
That's how we're starting.

00:00:57.498 --> 00:01:01.107
(audience cheering)

00:01:01.107 --> 00:01:04.427
♪ They say we're young and we don't know ♪

00:01:04.427 --> 00:01:09.427
♪ We won't find out until we grow ♪

00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:14.625
♪ Well, I don't know if all that's true ♪

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:19.625
♪ You got me and baby I got you ♪

00:01:20.817 --> 00:01:23.598
♪ Babe ♪

00:01:23.598 --> 00:01:26.725
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:01:26.725 --> 00:01:30.303
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:01:30.303 --> 00:01:33.872
♪ They say our love won't pay the rent ♪

00:01:33.872 --> 00:01:38.872
♪ Before it's earned, our
money's all been spent ♪

00:01:40.038 --> 00:01:43.436
♪ I guess that's so, we don't have a pot ♪

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:48.436
♪ But at least I'm sure
of all the things we got ♪

00:01:50.022 --> 00:01:52.768
♪ Babe ♪

00:01:52.768 --> 00:01:55.953
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:01:55.953 --> 00:01:59.495
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:01:59.495 --> 00:02:02.778
♪ So let them say your hair's too long ♪

00:02:02.778 --> 00:02:07.778
♪ 'Cause I don't care,
with you I can't go wrong ♪

00:02:09.126 --> 00:02:12.761
♪ Then put your tiny little hand in mine ♪

00:02:12.761 --> 00:02:16.485
♪ There ain't no hill or
mountain we can't climb ♪

00:02:16.485 --> 00:02:17.652
That's right!

00:02:19.226 --> 00:02:22.520
♪ I got you to hold my hand ♪

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.954
♪ I got you to understand ♪

00:02:25.954 --> 00:02:28.903
♪ I got you to walk with me ♪

00:02:28.903 --> 00:02:32.664
♪ I got you to talk with me ♪

00:02:32.664 --> 00:02:35.470
♪ I got you to kiss goodnight ♪

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.985
♪ I got you to hold me tight ♪

00:02:38.985 --> 00:02:41.993
♪ I got you, I won't let go ♪

00:02:41.993 --> 00:02:46.993
♪ I got you to love me so ♪

00:02:47.929 --> 00:02:50.920
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.753
♪ I got you, babe ♪

00:02:57.421 --> 00:03:00.504
(audience cheering)

00:03:03.637 --> 00:03:06.440
One more time, give it up
for Jimmy Fallon, y'all.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.991
My band, Y'all.
(audience applauding)

00:03:08.991 --> 00:03:10.126
Oh, it's so fun.

